// of the FR-10 table, and assigning one of them as the hotkey takes it away in every application
// (FR-95 suppresses the hotkey whenever the program is active) with no warning anywhere. The
// number continues the block of the state strings, 3216…3231, because that is where the free
// numbers are; it has nothing to do with «Состояние» beyond that. ⛔ Not IDS_CAPTURE_RESERVED:
// «the system owns this key» would be a lie about a key the system does not own.
#define IDS_CAPTURE_TYPING      3228
