// program in every locale. The number continues the block of the state strings, 3216…3231, for the
// reason 3228 does; the language it is read in is the one Windows prefers, because the second copy
// exits before it reads any configuration.
#define IDS_ALREADY_RUNNING     3229
// Task T-34-5, findings Н80, Н84 and С1 — the first line of «Состояние» says what the program
// does NOW, in the words a person uses: four states, the health of the hook (silent removals,
// not the recoveries the FR-80 timer counts every thirty seconds) shown only when the journal is
// on, and the joiner between the two — in the table, so that a locale may change it. 3215 closes
